    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d507">

                <pb facs="0682" n="668" xml:id="pg668"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">894.00/2–2748</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Acting Political Adviser in Japan</hi> (<hi
                        rendition="#italic">Sebald</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                        State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">restricted</hi>
                        <lb/> No. 127</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Tokyo</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1948-02-27">February 27,
                        1948</date>.<lb/>[Received March 9.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer to the Foreign
                    Service Regulations and to enclose copies of a letter dated February 24, 1948,
                    addressed to General MacArthur,<anchor n="1" xml:id="d507-f1"/> and of a reply
                    dated February 27, 1948, which I handed to Mr. James C. Y. Shen, of the Central
                    News Agency of China, Tokyo, in my capacity as Chief of the Diplomatic Section
                    of this Headquarters and Chairman, Allied Council for Japan. My reply was made
                    at the request of General MacArthur, who personally approved the answers as
                    submitted.</p>
                <p>Respectfully yours,</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>W. J. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sebald</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d507-a1.xml" xpointer="d507-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
